{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade","id":1417964,"title":"Needing a blade","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-12T18:11:31-07:00","id":1417964,"title":"Needing a blade","content":"Long story short, Its my turn to be the player for now, and I wanted a 3 dot daiklave, perhaps something like a rhomphaia.<br /> <br /> What kind of evocations would well complement a void point stylist?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T00:51:46-07:00","id":1417995,"title":"","content":"Published 3 dot Artifacts, Shining Ice Mirror is good for Solar Single Point.<br /> <br /> Homebrew... what do you want it to so? Mechanically, stuff that plays into Join Battle and stuff that enhances your Defense would compliment your martial arts style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T03:37:15-07:00","id":1418011,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The character concept is: occult supernal eclipse, trained in a fencing school that sought to awaken the essence of its mortal pupils through occult experiments. He was the leader's trusted errand boy, securing exotic components, until he realised that the experiments went out of control and the school was corrupted into demon worship. When the leader invited him to take part in a ritual to 'empower' him, he figured out he was about to get sacrificed, lunged for his master's sword and exalted instead, fighting his way out. Now he's on the run and a sort of travelling exorcist for hire, still seeking to master the style and rebuild the school as what it was supposed to be. His anima display is rotating rings of sword blades forming a chrysanthemum.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23788,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","user":"Braininthejar","date":". 10-13-2020, 06:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T02:01:08-07:00","id":1418320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade?p=1417995#post1417995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mechanically, stuff that plays into Join Battle and stuff that enhances your Defense would compliment your martial arts style.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a bit of a problem with that, because 'being better at stuff' is what solar charms already do. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T02:27:37-07:00","id":1418324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Braininthejar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade?p=1418320#post1418320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There is a bit of a problem with that, because 'being better at stuff' is what solar charms already do. </div> </div> </div> </div>3 dot artifacts make you better at stuff<br /> 4 dot artifacts give you new options<br /> 5 dot artifacts give game changing new options<br /> N/A gives you world changing new options<br /> <br /> A 3 dot sword makes you better at some aspect of swording. Like Spring Razor's poison strikes, or the carefully aimed cuts of Shining Ice Mirror, or the partnership fighting of Courante and Galliard. <br /> <br /> If you want a sword that makes volcanos or turns folks to stone or houses a hidden city of ghosts then you need to spend more dots.<br /> <br /> Plus you can't combine Solar Charms from combat abilities with MA. So refluffing your favourite melee charms as Evocations on your orichalcum sword might be a boon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Braininthejar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade?p=1418011#post1418011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The character concept is: occult supernal eclipse, trained in a fencing school that sought to awaken the essence of its mortal pupils through occult experiments. He was the leader's trusted errand boy, securing exotic components, until he realised that the experiments went out of control and the school was corrupted into demon worship. When the leader invited him to take part in a ritual to 'empower' him, he figured out he was about to get sacrificed, lunged for his master's sword and exalted instead, fighting his way out. Now he's on the run and a sort of travelling exorcist for hire, still seeking to master the style and rebuild the school as what it was supposed to be. His anima display is rotating rings of sword blades forming a chrysanthemum.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Very, very cool. But what do you want your sword to do. Tell me the story of this sword. What is it made of, where did it come from, what did the old master use the sword for? I'm getting strong demonic vibes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 10-15-2020, 05:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T06:09:00-07:00","id":1418350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Braininthejar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade#post1417964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Long story short, Its my turn to be the player for now, and I wanted a 3 dot daiklave, perhaps something like a rhomphaia.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's your mental image of how they fight with it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T07:53:34-07:00","id":1418364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade?p=1418324#post1418324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very, very cool. But what do you want your sword to do. Tell me the story of this sword. What is it made of, where did it come from, what did the old master use the sword for? I'm getting strong demonic vibes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I described is as a rhompaia, which makes it a bit scythe-like. This could play into my general theme, (also, curved blades work well with my anima display, possibly hinting that the bladde used to be mine to begin with) but runs into the same problem - anything spirit-related I can probably already do with my occult charms. <br /> <br /> If I were to go in the opposite direction, towards 'fencing mastery' there is a pair of duelling katars in arms of the chosen. But they are a four dot artifact, and with how you describe the dots to work, adapting it down would probably be more complicated than just shaving one evocation off the top. <br /> <br /> Perhaps the first idea is better - a demon bunter's blade made to cut steel and spirit alike, that starts with some damage buff and then improves occult charms. (I've seen some weapons that directly improve specific charms. Any advice on how to do it without unbalanding them?) <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T11:59:37-07:00","id":1418399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1417964-needing-a-blade?p=1418350#post1418350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your mental image of how they fight with it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... how about... spectral blades of golden light that help me block and create openings? like after-images that sometimes become solid for a split second.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23788,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","user":"Braininthejar","date":". 10-15-2020, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}